---
import { AUDIO_START_HERE_HREF } from "~/data/series";
---

<aside aria-label="Start reading about my music setup" class="mt-8 max-w-reading">
  <a
    href={AUDIO_START_HERE_HREF}
    class="card-interactive group relative flex items-center gap-6 overflow-hidden rounded-lg border border-[var(--accent-200)] bg-surface-raised p-6 pl-7"
  >
    <span aria-hidden="true" class="absolute inset-y-0 left-0 w-1 bg-[var(--accent-500)]"></span>
    <span class="flex-1">
      <span class="eyebrow block mb-2">Start here</span>
      <span class="block text-h3 text-strong group-hover:text-accent-700 transition-colors">
        My Music After Spotify
      </span>
      <span class="mt-2 block text-body text-muted">
        Why I keep my own music, how I find something new, and what I take offline. The setup guides follow from there.
      </span>
    </span>
    <span
      aria-hidden="true"
      class="hidden sm:flex size-11 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-[var(--accent-100)] text-accent-700 transition-transform duration-[var(--dur-normal)] group-hover:translate-x-1"
    >→</span>
  </a>
</aside>
